  "brain_first": "“先给每段贴功能标签，再看这些标签怎么连接。”",
  "sort_order": 1026,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "How is the text organized? / Which structure",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1141
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "best describes...?",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1142
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1143
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "结构题不是看段落内容本身，而是看段落之间的功",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1144
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "能关系。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1145
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先给每段贴功能标签，再看这些标签怎么连接。”",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1146
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 常见结构：problem→solution；phenomenon→explanation；",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1147
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "claim→evidence；experiment→result；past→present→future。",
      "sourcePage": 41,
      "sourceIndex": 1148
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1149
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 每段写一个功能词：现象/问题/原因/例子/证据/解决/结果/展望。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1150
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 把标签连成箭头。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1151
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 与选项结构对照。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1152
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 若文章有研究过程，区分 method / result / implication。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1153
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1154
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1155
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1156
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 先提问题后给建议 → problem-solution",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1157
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 先观点后多个研究/数据 → claim-evidence",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1158
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 按年份推进 → chronological",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1159
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 结构能解释所有主要段落位置。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1160
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 若某一段难贴标签，先看它与上一段的连接词和第一句。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1161
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1162
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "P1塑料问题；P2新材料原理；P3实验结果；P4限制与未来。结构可概括为 problem → proposed",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1163
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "solution → evidence → limitation/future。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1164
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1165
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只看第一段和最后一段。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1166
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把“内容主题”当“结构”。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1167
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1168
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 每段功能是什么？",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1169
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 箭头顺序对吗？",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1170
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1171
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1172
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1173
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 结构题先贴标签，再连箭头。",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1174
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1176
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. problem→solution 怎么识别？",
      "sourcePage": 42,
      "sourceIndex": 1177
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. claim→evidence 怎么识别？",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1178
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. experiment→result 常见于哪类文？",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1179
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 结构题要逐句翻译吗？",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1180
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 结构判断最小单位？",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1181
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 先提出问题，后段给办法/结果。；2. 观点后跟数据、研究、例子。；3. 科学说明/研究报道。；4. 不",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1182
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "需要，给段落贴功能标签。；5. 段落/段群功能，而非个别词。",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1183
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R12 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R12”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 43,
      "sourceIndex": 1184
    }
  ],
